%description:
Tests that a cached path MTU estimate is aged out, so that a path MTU that has
grown again is eventually discovered (RFC 8201 Section 5.4).

Same scenario as IPv6_path_mtu_discovery (the r2-r3 link has an MTU of 1400
bytes and the client sends 1400-byte UDP datagrams once a second), but with
`pathMtuAgingTime` shortened from its 10-minute default to 5 seconds. The
client therefore drops its estimate every 5 seconds, sends a full-size datagram
again to see whether the path has improved, and -- because it has not -- learns
the same 1400-byte path MTU once more.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = ../../../../examples;../../../../src
network = inet.examples.ipv6.nclients.NClientsEth
sim-time-limit = 25s
cmdenv-express-mode = false
cmdenv-log-prefix = "%C: "

# number of client computers
*.n = 1

# Reduce MTU on r2's interface toward r3 to trigger Packet Too Big
*.r2.eth[1].*.mtu = 1400B

# retry the link MTU every 5 seconds instead of every 10 minutes
**.ipv6.ipv6.pathMtuAgingTime = 5s

**.cli[*].numApps = 1
**.cli[*].app[0].typename = "UdpBasicApp"
**.cli[*].app[0].destAddresses = "srv"
**.cli[*].app[0].destPort = 1000
**.cli[*].app[0].messageLength = 1400B

**.cli[*].app[0].startTime = 10s
**.cli[*].app[0].stopTime = 24s
**.cli[*].app[0].sendInterval = 1s

**.srv.numApps = 1
**.srv.app[0].typename = "UdpSink"
**.srv.app[0].localPort = 1000

# Ethernet NIC configuration
**.eth[*].queue.typename = "EthernetQosQueue"
**.eth[*].queue.dataQueue.typename = "DropTailQueue" # in routers
**.eth[*].queue.dataQueue.packetCapacity = 10  # in routers

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%subst: /omnetpp:://
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%# the estimate is dropped after the aging time ...
%contains-regex: stdout
NClientsEth\.cli\[0\]\.ipv6\.routingTable: Path MTU estimate 1400 for .* has aged out
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%# ... the client probes with a full-size datagram, and learns the same value again
%contains-regex: stdout
NClientsEth\.cli\[0\]\.ipv6\.routingTable: Path MTU for .* reduced to 1400
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%# only the probe datagrams are lost, the rest still get through
%contains: stdout
Received packet: (inet::Packet)UdpBasicAppData-13 (1400 B)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
